{"version":1,"content":"<p>【好靚啊😆】Apple 13 日正式發佈全新智能家居顯示器「HomeView」，宣告進軍附帶屏幕的智能家居中樞市場。</p><p>該裝置採用致敬經典 iMac G4 的懸浮式轉軸設計，結合 7 吋 Liquid Retina 顯示屏幕與半球型揚聲器底座，內置強悍的 A18 晶片並支援多用戶面容辨識技術，美國定價為 299 美元，預計於 11 月 13 日正式發售。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:01.863726+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":177,"images":0,"source":"HKEPC","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T01:15:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723968+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.723968+00:00","content_hash":"96bbe543ebadcb234056ed9c7e9581b6b14398a9838769debad92b7af27bf890","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}